<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108804" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπομνημᾰτ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>serving for memoirs</i> or
				<i>dissertations,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διάλογοι</span>
			<i>memoirs</i> in the form of dialogue, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				4.5
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραφή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					1.99S.
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρακτὴρ τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ap.Ty.
					<u>Ep.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ammon.
				<u>in Int.</u>
				213.31
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			): neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κόν, τό,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπόμνημα</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Rh.</u>
				2.196
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>serving for notes</i> or <i>commentary,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπος</span>
			<i>abbreviated</i> style, <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				60.29
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					18(1).529
				</span></i>
			; <i>by way of reminder,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Anon.
				<u>in EN</u>
				229.17
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
